==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (6,000%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Koronium]] spawns.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns.

==Strategy==
First, kill all Gories. Then, hit the base and lure Mr. Puffington to your base and burst him down with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and/or other rushers like [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. Once he dies, wait for Koronium to come near your base and kill him with [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba]]. The last enemy is THE SLOTH, who can easily be killed with anything since he has no more support.

